WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:03.560
Kokomi, time to eat!

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.590
Eat up.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:14.570
Mom, aren't you making 
more food than usual lately?

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.240
Your tournament is coming up soon.

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.760
You need lots of nourishment.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.840
There's plenty more, so eat up.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:24.560
Right.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:42.840
I knew it...

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:21.720
<b>Blue Melon Buns</b>

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:19.940
Good morning.

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:21.780
Good morning, Shiina-san.

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:23.320
Morning.

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:24.450
Wearing track clothes today?

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:26.540
Hm? Yeah.

00:02:27.050 --> 00:02:29.330
It's gotten colder out,

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:32.890
and I don't want to catch a cold 
with the tournament coming up.

00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:34.990
It is cooler,

00:02:34.990 --> 00:02:37.880
but don't you think it feels nice and refreshing?

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:41.970
Yeah, it really makes you feel like working hard.

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:44.970
Hm? What's wrong?

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.150
It's nothing.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.350
<b>Rhythmic Gymnastics Team</b>

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:54.850
<i>I can't let such silly things get to me.</i>

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:57.610
<i>I need to focus on practice.</i>

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:02.570
Good morning!

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:04.540
Good morning...

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:05.400
Huh?

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:06.850
Didn't get enough sleep?

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:10.720
For a model, staying up all 
night is bad for your skin.

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:12.580
How many hours did you sleep?

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:14.920
About twelve hours?

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:18.180
I slept so much, I'm tired...

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:20.340
Ah, so that's why.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:33.450
Wow...

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:34.900
Amazing...

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:39.570
An interview?

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:40.320
That's right.

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:42.860
During today's lunch broadcast,

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:45.380
we're supposed to interview the 
school's most famous students

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:48.880
on the "Attacking the School's Hottest!" segment,

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:51.560
but today's guest got sick and can't come.

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:54.920
I know it's sudden, but I was 
hoping I could ask you, Nao-chan.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.970
I'm not famous...

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:01.280
I don't know many people, either...

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:03.210
What are you saying?

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:06.760
You're a model. Lots of 
girls would love to do that!

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:09.240
I'm sure people would like to hear about you.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:11.350
You really think so?

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:12.920
Okay, Miyoshi-san,

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:15.610
what would you like to do the most right now?

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:17.740
Uh... Go back to sleep?

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:19.920
Go back to sleep?

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:21.890
See?

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:23.650
That was awesome!

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.320
Seriously awesome!

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:28.410
Your realistic performance really 
impressed me, Shiina-san!

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.470
Really?

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:34.730
I can tell how pumped you are 
for the tournament coming up.

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:37.800
Your body looks really well-balanced, too!

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:39.550
Well-balanced?

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:43.040
Yeah, it feels like there's so much 
weight to your performance.

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:44.750
Weight...?

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:49.690
I have to get back to class.

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.340
I'm sorry.

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:55.320
Huh?

00:04:57.130 --> 00:05:00.090
Wouldn't Shiina-san be better?

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:01.600
For your interview.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:04.010
Shiina-san, huh?

00:05:04.590 --> 00:05:08.220
It's true that everyone's expecting her 
to do well in the next tournament.

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:10.300
Well, there you go.

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:13.950
Huh? Hey, that's completely beside the point!

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:19.980
As you can see, by not making the reason 
why the teacher killed himself obvious,

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:23.080
Soseki gives the readers room 
to use their imaginations...

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:25.880
<i>Now that I think about it, 
my mom really has been...</i>

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:28.090
I made fried mincemeat cutlets tonight,

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:31.270
so you can <i>fry</i> your competition at the tournament!

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:32.060
Get it?

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:36.000
<i>If she sticks with that pun, she'll 
be making a lot of fried foods...</i>

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:38.840
<i>They taste good, so I end 
up eating them, but still...</i>

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:43.520
<i>And I've had morning practice every day,</i>

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:46.420
<i>so I end up eating too much at lunch.</i>

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:49.700
So, Shiina-san,

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:53.600
do you know the proverb that means 
"your actions have consequences"

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:56.360
that would appropriately match this situation?

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:57.000
Yes.

00:05:57.560 --> 00:05:59.450
"What goes around, comes around."

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:00.750
That's correct.

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:05.320
There's also a similar proverb that 
says, "You reap what you sow."

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:08.690
But "what goes around, comes around" 
originates with Buddhist teachings,

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:16.760
<b>What goes around 
comes around</b>

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:16.760
<b>You reap 
what you sow</b>

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:13.250
which instruct that your actions, 
right and wrong, will be repaid in kind.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:16.770
Recently, it's often used to refer to "bad karma."

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:19.990
Let's turn to the next page.

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:23.650
<i>I need to go on a diet.</i>

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:27.010
An interview?

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:28.150
That's right.

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:31.610
I asked Miyoshi-san from our class,

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:32.740
but she ran away.

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:36.870
You mean the Miyoshi-san who's a model, right?

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:38.170
Yeah.

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:39.800
Then your name came up

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:44.120
because the whole school is rooting
for your win in rhythmic gymnastics.

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:45.880
I see...

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:49.120
Please! I'm begging you!

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:52.930
Sure. I'll do it.

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:57.070
Thank you!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.440
Sorry.

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:03.570
N-No, it's okay.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:08.420
It's time for Akane Sakurai's 
"Attacking the School's Hottest!"

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:09.940
Today's guest is Kokomi Shiina,

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:13.040
a second-year student who's 
expected to make high marks

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:15.660
in the upcoming fall rhythmic 
gymnastics tournament.

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:18.390
Hi there.

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:19.760
Um...

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:20.250
Yes?

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.830
I didn't know we'd have such a big audience...

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:26.250
That just shows how much they believe in you.

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:29.660
<i>Now then, Shiina-san,</i>

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:32.400
<i>what's your biggest concern right now?</i>

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:33.140
Hm?

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:34.880
Um...

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:36.480
My wei—

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:41.290
I-I mean, a way to do well in the tournament!

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:45.350
I guess that's why you're 
practicing so hard every day.

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:48.050
I hear you worked hard this morning, too,

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:52.040
but don't you get hungry during class 
after practicing all morning?

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:53.410
I don't!

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:58.190
What? Aren't you starving by lunch time?

00:07:58.190 --> 00:08:00.200
N-Not at all...

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:02.790
I see...

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:06.480
But don't you ever crave your favorite foods?

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:07.790
What do you like to eat?

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:11.890
Melon buns.

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:16.050
Um, these are the kinds of questions you ask?

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:20.960
Yeah, we ask about people's hobbies, 
their favorite music, movies...

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:24.170
And when we can, their weight 
and measurements, too!

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:25.350
Just kidding.

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:28.820
Weight and measurements....

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:31.480
Hm? Shiina-san?

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:33.430
I can't tell you that!

00:08:39.110 --> 00:08:41.450
I-I'm sorry...

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:46.960
<i>That was today's guest, Kokomi Shiina-san!</i>

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:52.140
Everyone, good luck in your 
afternoon clubs and classes!

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:54.510
See you. Bye-bye!

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:56.800
Okay, that's a wrap.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:58.630
Good job!

00:08:58.630 --> 00:09:02.020
I'm sorry I wasn't able to help that much.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:03.760
Don't worry.

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:06.510
It was pretty interesting, in several ways.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:09.520
It was?

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:16.570
I couldn't see a thing on the chalkboard.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:18.500
<i>The tournament's almost here...</i>

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:21.990
<i>I'm not going to be able to 
focus on practice like this.</i>

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.120
<i>I have to do something.</i>

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:26.890
<b>Trendy blue and seasonal plaid!</b>

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:26.890
<b>Try a striped knit for 
a rock 'n' roll style!</b>

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:36.380
<b>Dictionary of Plants
Food Safety
Fasting to Nourish Your Intuition
Choosing How You Eat: A Specialist's Guide
Balancing Vegetables and Meats
The Power of Wine
LOHAS Eating
Foods to Build Your Body
Foods for Beauty
Reducing Cholesterol Intake
The Book of Vegetables
Slow Food
Food Rules
The Book of Vegetables: How to Eat
Nutritional Science for Your Life
Dictionary of Food Labels</b>

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:36.380
If you're going to go on a diet,

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:40.600
you need to watch what you eat.

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:45.130
<b>Fun and Easy
Everything We Know About Food Nutrition</b>

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:44.680
Everything We Know About Food Nutrition...

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.230
Maybe this'll help.

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:50.120
This doesn't seem quite right.

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:57.410
I wonder if the school library 
even has books about dieting...

00:09:57.410 --> 00:09:58.740
Are you looking for something?

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:02.100
Murakami-senpai!

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:04.620
I heard the radio show today.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:05.870
It was pretty interesting.

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:08.990
Th-Thank you.

00:10:08.990 --> 00:10:11.640
Are you looking for a particular book?

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:13.340
Oh... Well...

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:15.130
How should I explain?

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:19.500
<i>I can't tell her I'm looking for 
a book on dieting because</i>

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:23.430
<i>I've gained some weight and want to lose it...</i>

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:26.020
Are you looking for home ec books?

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:27.880
No, um...

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:29.620
More like nutritional science.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:31.280
Nutritional science?

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:33.440
Are you hoping to become a nutritionist?

00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:36.140
No, how should I put it...

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:43.760
I'd like to know how the body 
can efficiently burn calories...

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:46.490
So, something more scientific?

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:49.300
The science section is over there.

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:50.920
No, that's not it...

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:55.440
"Burn it up, young people!" Right?

00:10:57.390 --> 00:10:58.750
Chloe-san...

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:03.660
You're burning it up right now, Kokomi-san!

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:04.930
Isn't that right?

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:09.430
No, that's not really what I'm talking about...

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.940
Japanese teens are wonderful.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.710
You really get into clubs and sports.

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:18.320
We don't have that in France.

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:21.380
You're also into anime.

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:24.200
We don't have that in France, either.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:29.320
Burn (moe)

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:27.600
I don't think that's what she meant by burning...

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:29.320
Cute (moe)

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:29.330
It's not?!

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:31.020
<b>He wall-slammed Yoshiko! I'm so jealous!</b>

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:35.920
But that's why all those blogs 
catch on like wildfire, isn't it?

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:33.600
<b>Screw you!

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:39.520
This topic is neither here nor there at this point...

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:42.320
What? No, we're right here.

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:47.600
I'm talking about what teens 
are into right here and now.

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:51.350
You're only young once, you know, Kokomi-san!

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:55.270
You want to go on a diet, right?

00:11:55.950 --> 00:11:57.120
Miyoshi-san.

00:11:57.120 --> 00:11:58.920
A diet?

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:03.820
I think Shiina-san is looking for a book on diets.

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:07.320
That's why you asked about nutritional science.

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:10.080
You're really into diets, Kokomi-san?

00:12:11.860 --> 00:12:14.050
Not that...

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:18.250
She wants to burn fat more efficiently, so...

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:24.460
Why do Japanese girls all want to go on diets?!

00:12:24.460 --> 00:12:25.530
Now, now...

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:27.170
But, why?!

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:29.760
I don't understand.

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:30.860
Now, now...

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:34.280
Shiina-san, over here.

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:37.270
Hmph! Japanese girls just don't understand 
the joys of being soft and squishy!

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:42.160
This is the school library,

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:45.740
so I don't think there are any 
decent books on dieting, but...

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:49.100
These girls' magazines do have

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:51.920
specials on how girls can go about dieting.

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:52.990
Um...

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:53.650
Hm?

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:56.980
How did you know that
 I wanted to go on a diet?

00:12:57.620 --> 00:12:58.810
Well...

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:01.220
The way you talked this morning,

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:03.220
and during your interview just now,

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:04.590
just gave me a hunch.

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:08.950
Your conversations with the older 
girls just made it sound that way.

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:10.600
I see.

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:14.600
That said, I really envy you.

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:17.020
Huh? Why?

00:13:17.550 --> 00:13:19.460
You're able to get along 
with girls in other classes,

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:21.730
and even with upperclassmen.

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:25.240
You know, like this morning, and even just now...

00:13:26.090 --> 00:13:28.980
Harumiya-san is from my class, right?

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:32.360
But it looked like you talk 
to her more than I do...

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:36.790
You also seemed like you were pretty 
close with the third-years just now.

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:38.600
No...

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:42.120
I don't think I'm really that close to them...

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:43.870
You think so?

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:47.440
I think you're doing much better than I am.

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:53.020
I almost never talk to people 
from other classes or grades.

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:54.680
I mean, I'm not in any clubs.

00:13:55.360 --> 00:13:59.020
Your modeling work doesn't leave 
much time for clubs, does it?

00:13:59.660 --> 00:14:01.490
Yeah...

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:03.880
But, I get to do what I like,

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:05.850
so I can't complain.

00:14:09.770 --> 00:14:12.630
Lunch is over.

00:14:12.630 --> 00:14:13.590
Let's get going.

00:14:23.810 --> 00:14:25.300
I don't understand!

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:30.650
Why do Japanese girls care so much about dieting?

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:34.920
Why do they want to fight against 
calories, as if they're the enemy?

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:37.040
I think you're exaggerating a little,

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:42.060
but it might be true that everyone 
sometimes focuses on dieting too much.

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:45.920
Japan has the best chicken in the world,

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:47.820
your fried chicken!

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:52.180
The best chicken in the world?

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:52.820
Oui.

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:56.950
French people love chicken, 
but it puts ours to blame!

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:58.720
That's "puts ours to shame."

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:02.160
But if everyone is afraid of calories,

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:05.800
then making good fried 
chicken is futility exercise!

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:08.470
That's "an exercise in futility."

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:13.400
Girls want to go on diets because 
that's how girls think.

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:16.040
They want to be prettier if they can.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:19.680
Kokomi-san is plenty beautiful.

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:23.550
She doesn't need to go on a diet.

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:25.440
That might be true.

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:27.610
It <i>is</i> true!

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:34.310
Girl Friend BETA.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:38.540
A diet?

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:39.600
Yeah.

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:43.040
You were worried about going on a diet, right?

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:44.720
No...

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:47.400
I don't know what you're talking about...

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:53.080
I was.

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:54.680
I knew it!

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:56.110
I'm sorry...

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:57.720
I was too embarrassed to say anything.

00:15:58.040 --> 00:16:00.470
It's nothing to be embarrassed about!

00:16:00.470 --> 00:16:02.460
I know how you feel, though.

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:06.440
You don't want people to know you're 
worried about your weight, right?

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:11.260
Well, dieting is a concern that 
all girls have in common.

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:14.990
I think we should help each other out.

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:16.370
Huh?

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:19.870
Then, Kagami-san, Harumiya-san, you're also...

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:21.440
Actually...

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:22.830
That's right.

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.740
So... Everyone!

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:29.380
We're the exercise club for second-years, 
the Diet Alliance... I guess?

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:31.760
We're fighting hard, too.

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.880
So you can fight along with us.

00:16:35.150 --> 00:16:36.800
Hey!

00:16:37.090 --> 00:16:39.180
Include me, too!

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:41.360
You should have just asked us, Kokomi-chan!

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:42.870
But, Sagara-san,

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:45.050
you're part of the street 
performing society, right?

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:47.850
Street performing is a sport, too!

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:50.690
I think she just wants to be in the group.

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:52.720
Well, that might be true.

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:56.990
Honestly...

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:56.990
Of course you can join.

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:57.870
Okay!

00:16:58.400 --> 00:17:00.120
Let's all work hard!

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:01.920
Yeah!

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:06.120
Hurry up.

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:07.880
Let's get going.

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:10.700
We're going to leave you behind.

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:12.000
Wait for us!

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:13.800
I can't keep up!

00:17:22.610 --> 00:17:24.140
Huh...

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:26.810
I still don't get it.

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:29.760
Japanese culture is confusing...

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:31.900
I don't think you need to 
think about it that hard.

00:17:32.740 --> 00:17:40.370
23, 24, 25...

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:37.530
What's going on there?

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:37.910
Huh?

00:17:42.570 --> 00:17:44.200
I can't do any more...

00:17:44.970 --> 00:17:48.130
Wasn't street performing 
supposed to be a real sport?

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:52.880
It is, but you don't really 
use your abdominal muscles.

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:53.920
Probably.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.760
Sagara-san, you're almost there.

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:59.280
Keep it up. Do it for your diet.

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:01.870
Yeah...

00:18:02.360 --> 00:18:04.090
You're right.

00:18:04.090 --> 00:18:06.240
26...

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:07.810
26...

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:09.390
They're...

00:18:09.390 --> 00:18:11.560
I understand now, Fumio-san!

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:14.190
Dieting is proof of your friendship!

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:17.390
This is what being young is all about!

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:19.530
Yeah, I guess so.

00:18:58.460 --> 00:19:00.030
I'm so tired.

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:03.670
I've never pushed myself this hard before.

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:08.170
But it kind of feels good to work 
hard with everyone together.

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:10.920
Yeah, it's kind of a nice exhaustion.

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:13.250
I wonder if I lost any weight.

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:16.880
I'm sure you did, after all that.

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:20.170
Good work!

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:22.740
Sakurai-san?

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:26.490
The interview was worth it, 
since it got the exercise club

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:28.720
to help you out, Shiina-san!

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:30.540
I couldn't be happier!

00:19:31.420 --> 00:19:32.640
What are you talking about?

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:37.640
Everyone wanted to help you train for 
your upcoming tournament, right?

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:39.330
Well...

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:40.910
Here's a little something

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:45.910
that everyone got for you after hearing today's 
show and seeing your friendships in action.

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:47.330
Here you go!

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:48.820
Bam!

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:55.170
Now, I'm sure you're all 
hungry after working out.

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:57.170
Go on, eat up.

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:07.600
<i>I can't eat them...</i>

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:16.020
<i>I can't eat them, I can't eat them...</i>

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:20.320
They're so good...

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.400
I can't stop...

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:23.770
How are they, Shiina-san?

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:24.910
They're good...

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:26.660
I see!

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:28.440
So good, it makes you cry, huh?

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:29.700
I'm so glad.

00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:33.650
There's plenty more, so eat up.

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:38.120
Shiina-san.

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:39.840
How's your diet going?

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:42.840
Not well.

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:46.140
I... I see.

00:20:47.610 --> 00:20:48.810
I understand.

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:52.010
So that's why it's not going well.

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:52.800
Yeah.

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:55.540
But maybe that's to be expected.

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:57.060
Huh? Why?

00:20:57.320 --> 00:20:58.790
When you put on more muscle,

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:01.380
of course your weight goes up.

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:04.880
Muscle weighs three times as much as fat.

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:05.740
Oh...

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:08.260
Instead of putting on muscle,

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:12.450
you'll need to make your body more flexible.

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:16.830
Um, have you gone on 
a diet before, Miyoshi-san?

00:21:17.140 --> 00:21:18.530
No,

00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:21.150
but I have to watch my figure

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:24.630
and weight without overdoing it.

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:26.640
I see.

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:28.930
You're a model, after all.

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:32.960
Anyway, you can't put on too much muscle.

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:37.800
To keep your proportions, 
you need to build up your core.

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:38.730
Okay.

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:42.470
You should also try aerobic 
exercise and half-body baths.

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:45.790
You can't just starve yourself, either.

00:21:45.790 --> 00:21:47.630
You need have balanced meals,

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:51.640
and make sure you don't get too many carbs.

00:21:53.060 --> 00:21:55.200
I had too many melon buns...

00:21:55.590 --> 00:21:59.970
If you can do that, you'll be fine.

00:21:59.970 --> 00:22:01.510
Good luck.

00:22:01.510 --> 00:22:03.330
Oh, um...

00:22:03.330 --> 00:22:04.360
What is it?

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:07.170
Will you help me with my diet?

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:12.730
If you'll teach me how to diet properly, 
I'll feel more at ease,

00:22:12.730 --> 00:22:15.690
and I'll be able to focus on my tournament.

00:22:15.690 --> 00:22:16.930
Please?

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:19.190
Sure.

00:22:39.800 --> 00:22:42.600
Shiina-san, I heard you got past the prelims!

00:22:42.600 --> 00:22:44.350
Congratulations!

00:22:44.350 --> 00:22:45.670
Thank you.

00:22:45.670 --> 00:22:48.550
And your diet went well, too, right?

00:22:48.940 --> 00:22:50.390
What?!

00:22:50.390 --> 00:22:52.880
It's all thanks to Miyoshi-san's advice.

00:22:52.880 --> 00:22:55.280
I was able to focus on the 
tournament because of her.

00:22:55.280 --> 00:22:56.820
Way to go!

00:22:57.290 --> 00:22:58.480
Good morning...

00:22:59.300 --> 00:23:00.720
Good morning!

00:23:04.780 --> 00:23:06.110
What is it?

00:23:06.370 --> 00:23:08.680
Please, Miyoshi-san!

00:23:08.680 --> 00:23:12.130
Please teach me how to diet properly, too!

00:23:12.760 --> 00:23:14.030
Me, too!

00:23:14.030 --> 00:23:16.120
Same for me!

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:18.500
I think we could all benefit from this.

00:23:18.800 --> 00:23:20.890
So teach me, too!

00:23:20.890 --> 00:23:23.130
Eh? H-Huh?

00:23:23.130 --> 00:23:26.000
You're Nao-chan, right?

00:23:26.630 --> 00:23:27.960
You're really pretty.

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:31.670
Could you teach me how to diet, too?

00:23:31.670 --> 00:23:33.300
Huh? Why did you...

00:23:34.570 --> 00:23:38.410
It's so wonderful how diets 
bring people together!

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:40.800
Scales grew on my eyes!

00:23:40.800 --> 00:23:42.300
Help me diet,

00:23:42.300 --> 00:23:45.570
and let me take some pictures 
of you while we're at it!

00:23:46.080 --> 00:23:49.480
Erena-san, you're trying 
to take advantage of her.

00:23:49.480 --> 00:23:51.640
Oh, you figured me out?

00:23:51.640 --> 00:23:53.490
Miyoshi-san, please!

00:23:53.820 --> 00:23:55.350
Please!

00:23:56.180 --> 00:23:57.240
Okay.

00:23:57.680 --> 00:23:59.350
Let's all work together.

00:23:59.350 --> 00:24:00.780
All right!

00:24:00.780 --> 00:24:02.110
Yay!

00:24:09.960 --> 00:24:24.840
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:10.750 --> 00:24:12.510
Erena Mochizuki here.

00:24:12.510 --> 00:24:13.970
My hobby is photography.

00:24:15.010 --> 00:24:16.840
You're trying to do something bad again...

00:24:16.840 --> 00:24:18.040
Of course not!

00:24:18.040 --> 00:24:20.620
You've done it before, Mochizuki-san.

00:24:20.620 --> 00:24:24.380
See it in our next episode: Cameras and Shortcake.

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:24.840
<b>Episode 3: Cameras and Shortcake</b>
